## This licence covers the code. It does not cover the pictures.

`assets/fighters/` and `assets/props/` hold photographs licensed to this
project's owner, and photographs of people are not the author's to sublicense.
They are excluded from the published package (see `files` in `package.json`)
and you must supply your own — see `docs/ADDING-A-FIGHTER.md`.

The bundled typeface in `assets/fonts/` is DejaVu Sans, under the Bitstream
Vera and Arev fonts licences, which permit redistribution. It ships with the
package on purpose: text metrics are part of the rendered bytes, so the font
travelling with the code is what makes the same seed produce the same video on
a different machine.
